@startuml
title G10 - Donnees et source de verite

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "G10 API Gateway" as G10
database "Aucune base utilisateurs locale\nG10 ne stocke pas users/roles/tokens" as NoDb

component "G3 Gestion utilisateurs" as G3
database "User DB\npropriete G3" as UserDb

entity "users" as users {
  * id
  * email
  * passwordHash
  * role
  * enabled
  * emailVerified
}

entity "refresh_tokens" as refresh {
  * id
  * tokenHash
  * userId
  * revoked
  * expiresAt
}

entity "email_verification_tokens" as verify {
  * id
  * tokenHash
  * userId
  * expiresAt
}

entity "password_reset_tokens" as reset {
  * id
  * tokenHash
  * userId
  * expiresAt
}

G10 .. NoDb
G10 --> G3 : route /auth/**\nvalidate JWT signed by G3
G3 --> UserDb
UserDb -- users
users ||--o{ refresh
users ||--o{ verify
users ||--o{ reset

note bottom of G10
G10 peut avoir des logs techniques sur fichier,
mais pas de base metier utilisateurs.
end note

@enduml
